{
  "name": "unicode-company-names",
  "description": "Names that differ in script, width, composition and case. Fullwidth 'Rocket Labs', '<rocket> Rocket Labs <rocket>' and plain 'Rocket Labs' are one company; its name is the earliest posting, and the tie between the fullwidth and emoji spellings goes to the smaller CODE POINT (U+FF32 < U+1F680; UTF-16 order would pick the emoji). Aliases sort by code point. 'Stra\u00dfe GmbH' (sharp s) and 'STRASSE GmbH' are different companies; Turkish dotted capital I and ASCII I are different; decomposed accents compose; CJK/Cyrillic keys are kept; fullwidth 'Acme Inc.' joins 'Acme'.",
